  "title": "Norway’s King Harald V passes away at 89, marking his longest reign and a clash between tradition and modernity",
  "summary": "King Harald V of Norway, the longest-serving monarch, died at the age of 89, marking a significant shift in the royal family’s tradition of marrying commoners and its modernization. His death triggered a stormy succession as his son, Haakon, faced intense political scrutiny over his wife’s links to Jeffrey Epstein.",
